//avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1915,"digest":"sha256:68043302042cdfbd7411db50a9e500d8678907d8a176d3c9eacba2e561825a04","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-23T02:35:24Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T02:35:24Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.89.0/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.89.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.89.0","body":"## RevealLine v0.89.0 — Varied field-enemy courses\n\nMoving Solo bouncers and Team drifters now follow gradual, seeded curves instead of repeating constant reflected headings. Both Versus boards share the same authored course behavior. Enemy speed targets, patrol domains, fixed-timestep movement, swept collisions, warning/commit protection, and explicit pursuit rules remain unchanged.\n\nFresh attempts use the new `gp3` recipe. Historical `gp1`/`gp2` replays retain their original reconstruction, including a byte-identical frozen `gp2` adapter.\n\nSource: `9374f7fab315a2b9145d699cb4548fb7807b1380` (tree `d4338abbf5c65809af38a398cedf0d9fcae86b7f`), merged through [PR #285](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/pull/285).\n\nThe exact-head [PR checks](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35808406051) passed preflight and the ordinary production build. The focused development cohort passed 38 checks and exercised replay compatibility, equal Versus boards, Team curves, freeze/stun behavior, one-cell corridors, and warning/commit protection. Catalogue validation covered 819 Solo, 108 Team, and 192 retained Classic variants; those counts are structural validation rather than completed-playthrough or balance claims.\n\nThe actual merged-source [qualification and freeze](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35809712239) passed source identity, validation, lint, formatting, native formatting, motion syntax, production reproduction/readiness, and the immutable freeze. Automated suites were explicitly waived under the temporary reviewed policy; no passing full-suite verdict is claimed.\n\nThe guarded read-only [artifact inspection](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35810322325) verified every Git source blob/type/mode and source TAR commit, every distribution manifest byte and hash chain, and the bounded offline inventory. The PR-head-to-merge difference is limited to 62 previously accepted Pages-controller and v0.88 preservation files; no game, package, lockfile, workflow, or test content changed after the reviewed PR head.\n\nOriginal distribution: 591,098,295 bytes, SHA-256 `afabe1075b6c2bbdc9c1aae98ffbfa462a8a3f1b2478ae36aeac65d60afac622`.\n\nOriginal source archive: 1,622,640,640 bytes, SHA-256 `d382f64d6ac256d42fbfd2229dc80f19d2e3cf570545531f3dce79431a3e6ba8`.\n\nPages selection, public byte verification, and bounded browser checks remain separate acceptance gates until the selector PR is merged and the deployed site is checked. Physical controllers, physical touch, cold-offline use, full campaign balance, and musical/listening acceptance are not claimed by this release package.\n"}
